{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2013-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1362096000, "end_date": 1362700799, "month_true_total": 24, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:47:24 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "1098419", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986666314", "personaname": "GreatWhiteNorth", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197986666314/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3658, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2894, "last_played": 1633559758, "avatar": "a5d75cb3a2a58ded736af543770154144d2cb97e"}, "language": "english", "review": "NO MERCY NO REGRET NO FEAR!\nThese are the Space Marines, geneticaly altered mas killing machines sent in when the ♥♥♥♥ really hits the fan. Very true to the 40k vers, playing a single space marine lets you know how much ass they do kick! Chainsaw-sword? Check. Blood and gore? Check. Orkses? DAKKA DAKKA DAKKA! .988 Godwin pattern Bolter, fireing explosive tipped armor pericing projectiles with high rate of fire? Check.", "timestamp_created": 1362680495, "timestamp_updated": 1362680495, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "889959", "author": {"steamid": "76561197981149305", "personaname": "Lokly", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LonelyLokly/", "num_games_owned": 302, "num_reviews": 89, "playtime_forever": 591, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 347, "last_played": 1470657713, "avatar": "2642d1c02bdb96f66d508aab6da5e7805082a4e7"}, "language": "english", "review": "A very solid game. Simple mechanics, but so well made.", "timestamp_created": 1362